# What Vercel does not need to build or serve this app.
#
# The build is `cd web && npm ci && npm run build`, and the deployed artefacts are web/dist plus
# the edge function in api/. Everything below is authoring apparatus: it is the reason the app is
# trustworthy, but none of it is read at build or request time.

.venv/
spike/
blender/
pipeline/
snapshots/
docs/
*.docx
.githooks/
Makefile
CLAUDE.md

# built fresh by the build command
web/dist/
web/node_modules/

# the QA harness drives a browser; it never runs on Vercel
web/tools/
